== Leveling XP ==
{{Skill|Hunting|XP}} can be gained though various means:
=== Hunting and Fusion ===
'''Hunting''' experience can be gained by [[Hunting#Hunting Methods|Hunting]] mobs with various methods and from [[Attribute Fusion]].

The amount of XP gained depends on the rarity of the shard. 
